WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:42.470
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:42.740 --> 01:47.979
[When I Meet The Moon]

3
01:48.110 --> 01:51.100
[Episode 4]

4
02:03.260 --> 02:05.900
This Little Kid does talk nonsense all the time,

5
02:05.900 --> 02:08.300
but he's quite reliable when he's working.

6
02:14.800 --> 02:15.780
Smells so good.

7
02:16.190 --> 02:17.320
It'll be ready soon.

8
02:24.130 --> 02:24.930
Tangy!

9
02:25.250 --> 02:27.250
What kind of cursed cuisine is this?

10
02:31.180 --> 02:33.370
I was just trying to expand

11
02:33.400 --> 02:34.950
our guesthouse's menu.

12
02:35.530 --> 02:36.710
Just leave it to me.

13
02:36.870 --> 02:39.120
Why don't you go help Lili?

14
02:39.470 --> 02:40.990
I don't want anyone to get food poisoning

15
02:40.990 --> 02:42.280
before we even open.

16
02:42.310 --> 02:43.680
Go help her. Go ahead.

17
02:46.430 --> 02:47.760
What are you staring at?

18
02:48.790 --> 02:49.990
You were spacing out.

19
02:52.190 --> 02:53.460
The meat is burnt!

20
02:54.980 --> 02:55.700
Well...

21
02:55.960 --> 02:57.430
I... I was just thinking about something

22
02:57.430 --> 02:58.760
and zoning out for a bit.

23
03:00.080 --> 03:01.940
Thinking about your sweetheart?

24
03:02.930 --> 03:03.930
What sweetheart?

25
03:05.240 --> 03:07.900
Tang Lin said she wanted some sweetheart cakes.

26
03:15.090 --> 03:16.400
Your sweetheart is here.

27
03:16.400 --> 03:16.910
Uncle!

28
03:16.910 --> 03:18.640
Remember to say hi to him later.

29
03:24.030 --> 03:25.490
You even brought red wine?

30
03:37.310 --> 03:38.060
Well,

31
03:38.060 --> 03:38.860
Xia,

32
03:38.960 --> 03:40.090
w-we don't have enough food.

33
03:40.090 --> 03:41.350
I'll chop up some more.

34
03:58.370 --> 03:59.180
Here, Uncle.

35
04:00.620 --> 04:01.410
Thanks,

36
04:01.480 --> 04:02.280
Lili.

37
04:02.810 --> 04:03.620
Thank you.

38
04:05.410 --> 04:06.340
What about mine?

39
04:06.650 --> 04:08.470
I don't even have enough for myself.

40
04:08.470 --> 04:09.650
Don't you still have some more?

41
04:09.650 --> 04:10.620
Give me one.

42
04:11.780 --> 04:13.510
I don't have enough for myself.

43
04:16.010 --> 04:16.810
Tangy,

44
04:17.250 --> 04:18.360
don't stoop to the level

45
04:18.360 --> 04:19.120
of an ill-mannered brat.

46
04:19.120 --> 04:20.850
Take this freshly grilled one.

47
04:21.870 --> 04:23.270
Xia, you're the best.

48
04:23.660 --> 04:25.270
How can we have a barbecue without cola?

49
04:25.270 --> 04:26.470
I'll fetch some cola.

50
04:29.360 --> 04:29.980
There's

51
04:29.980 --> 04:31.160
a freshly made crepe roll in the fridge.

52
04:31.160 --> 04:32.270
Can you get it for me?

53
04:32.270 --> 04:32.980
Sure.

54
04:42.120 --> 04:43.000
Make way.

55
04:43.480 --> 04:44.120
Old Auntie,

56
04:44.120 --> 04:45.680
first come, first served.

57
04:45.680 --> 04:47.340
Can't you wait until I'm done?

58
04:48.360 --> 04:49.159
Move away.

59
05:17.850 --> 05:19.980
Thank goodness the cola didn't spill.

60
05:44.060 --> 05:44.860
Lili!

61
05:46.860 --> 05:47.659
Your milk.

62
05:47.680 --> 05:48.470
Thanks.

63
05:54.250 --> 05:55.850
My uncle doesn't drink cola.

64
05:56.159 --> 05:56.770
Li.

65
06:10.220 --> 06:11.010
Um,

66
06:11.980 --> 06:13.690
why do Fu Zhengchu and Xia

67
06:13.720 --> 06:15.430
have different surnames?

68
06:15.890 --> 06:17.820
Aren't they biological siblings?

69
06:18.870 --> 06:21.000
Fu Zhengchu took my sister's surname.

70
06:22.360 --> 06:22.980
Xia Congsheng

71
06:22.980 --> 06:25.560
was supposed to take my sister's surname, too.

72
06:25.560 --> 06:26.720
Then was Fu Zhengchu

73
06:26.750 --> 06:28.750
supposed to take his dad's surname?

74
06:28.930 --> 06:29.430
Nope.

75
06:30.980 --> 06:33.180
My brother-in-law is quite henpecked.

76
06:33.370 --> 06:34.510
What about you?

77
06:37.870 --> 06:38.480
Well,

78
06:38.570 --> 06:41.300
I was asking if you're also afraid of your sister,

79
06:41.950 --> 06:44.980
not if you're afraid of... your wife.

80
06:47.990 --> 06:49.000
Yun Li,

81
06:49.330 --> 06:51.390
what nonsense are you talking about?

82
06:51.600 --> 06:52.200
By the way.

83
06:53.490 --> 06:55.740
What's your name?

84
06:56.590 --> 06:57.200
Yun Li.

85
06:58.060 --> 06:59.630
Yun Li... Li.

86
07:10.300 --> 07:12.070
He didn't mention the meme.

87
07:12.420 --> 07:14.480
I'll just pretend it never happened.

88
07:19.250 --> 07:20.060
Come on.

89
07:21.010 --> 07:21.810
Lili,

90
07:22.450 --> 07:23.810
are you going to register tomorrow?

91
07:23.810 --> 07:24.620
Yep.

92
07:24.950 --> 07:26.360
Why don't you go with us?

93
07:27.660 --> 07:28.860
No need to trouble you.

94
07:28.860 --> 07:29.860
I-I can just go

95
07:29.880 --> 07:30.880
with Tangy.

96
07:31.220 --> 07:31.950
It's no trouble.

97
07:31.950 --> 07:33.950
My uncle is driving us there anyway.

98
07:35.480 --> 07:36.610
Is that okay, Uncle?

99
07:37.920 --> 07:38.420
Mm.

100
07:47.159 --> 07:47.950
Lili,

101
07:47.980 --> 07:49.040
what's your major?

102
07:49.560 --> 07:50.360
Automation.

103
07:51.420 --> 07:52.220
How about this?

104
07:52.220 --> 07:53.570
You and my uncle may wait in the car.

105
07:53.570 --> 07:54.370
It's scorching hot outside.

106
07:54.370 --> 07:55.159
Let me go check where

107
07:55.159 --> 07:55.950
you need to register.

108
07:55.950 --> 07:56.420
It's fine.

109
07:56.420 --> 07:57.570
I can go by myself.

110
07:57.570 --> 07:58.450
You're not familiar with the campus.

111
07:58.450 --> 07:59.370
It'll be more trouble

112
07:59.370 --> 08:00.510
if you get lost.

113
08:00.960 --> 08:02.070
I'm off, Uncle.

114
08:02.720 --> 08:03.510
Thanks.

115
08:04.620 --> 08:05.420
Bye-bye.

116
08:20.480 --> 08:22.280
Thank you for giving us a lift...

117
08:24.160 --> 08:24.950
Uncle.

118
08:31.150 --> 08:31.650
Mm.

119
08:36.270 --> 08:37.860
I've actually been looking for

120
08:37.860 --> 08:39.220
an internship recently.

121
08:39.220 --> 08:40.400
Xia and Tangy

122
08:40.429 --> 08:41.809
helped me pick a few,

123
08:42.669 --> 08:43.480
but I'm still not sure

124
08:43.480 --> 08:45.140
which one to send my resume to.

125
08:45.510 --> 08:47.210
Could you help me take a look?

126
08:48.630 --> 08:49.130
Mm.

127
08:55.390 --> 08:57.580
Why did I bring this up?

128
08:57.580 --> 08:59.290
I should've just asked him if he

129
08:59.290 --> 09:00.530
minds me going to EAW.

130
09:00.530 --> 09:01.990
That would be much easier!

131
09:05.830 --> 09:06.620
If...

132
09:06.620 --> 09:07.200
EAW

133
09:07.200 --> 09:08.200
suits you better.

134
09:11.750 --> 09:12.270
Here.

135
09:13.690 --> 09:14.550
Thank you.

136
09:23.270 --> 09:24.580
Senior, senior...

137
09:24.650 --> 09:26.150
May I add you on WeChat?

138
09:30.680 --> 09:31.740
Thank you, senior.

139
09:31.830 --> 09:32.820
Playboy.

140
09:38.910 --> 09:39.510
The road is so wide.

141
09:39.510 --> 09:40.510
Are you blind?

142
09:40.870 --> 09:42.330
Keep your eyes on the road,

143
09:42.580 --> 09:44.120
not on pretty girls.

144
09:48.370 --> 09:50.370
What nonsense is she talking about?

145
09:50.460 --> 09:51.770
How baffling.

146
09:59.270 --> 10:00.400
It's scorching hot.

147
10:00.720 --> 10:01.510
I'm back.

148
10:02.480 --> 10:03.960
Did you find the registration place?

149
10:03.960 --> 10:05.050
It's right by the East Gate.

150
10:05.050 --> 10:06.010
It's crazy hot out there.

151
10:06.010 --> 10:07.810
Good thing Lili got to stay here.

152
10:10.720 --> 10:11.510
Lili.

153
10:12.770 --> 10:14.620
Why is your face so red?

154
10:16.650 --> 10:17.460
Is it?

155
10:19.890 --> 10:21.300
Maybe it's t-too hot.

156
10:22.580 --> 10:23.370
That's true.

157
10:23.870 --> 10:24.860
It's super hot.

158
10:25.250 --> 10:26.460
I was only out for 10 minutes,

159
10:26.460 --> 10:27.720
and I almost "melted."

160
10:28.270 --> 10:29.080
Buckle up.

161
10:41.580 --> 10:42.460
It's packed with people

162
10:42.460 --> 10:43.860
registering at this time.

163
10:43.860 --> 10:45.530
We should have come in another time slot.

164
10:45.530 --> 10:45.960
Mm.

165
10:46.750 --> 10:48.510
And it's really hot today.

166
10:48.620 --> 10:49.650
Are you feeling hot?

167
10:49.650 --> 10:50.150
Mm.

168
10:53.010 --> 10:54.540
Did Fu Shize drive you over?

169
10:56.130 --> 10:56.740
Mm.

170
10:59.870 --> 11:00.860
Why are you

171
11:00.860 --> 11:02.010
like a "mm" machine today?

172
11:02.010 --> 11:04.340
You just reply with "mm" to whatever I say.

173
11:04.820 --> 11:05.580
Maybe because someone

174
11:05.580 --> 11:07.410
kept saying "mm" to me,

175
11:07.550 --> 11:09.080
I picked up this habit, too.

176
11:09.620 --> 11:10.120
"Mm."

177
11:10.870 --> 11:12.270
You mean Fu Shize, right?

178
11:12.500 --> 11:13.000
Mm.

179
11:15.080 --> 11:16.770
People subconsciously

180
11:16.770 --> 11:18.250
imitate the ones they like.

181
11:18.250 --> 11:19.370
In psychology,

182
11:19.370 --> 11:21.150
this is called mirroring.

183
11:22.530 --> 11:23.510
It just kind of

184
11:23.510 --> 11:24.390
bothers me.

185
11:24.980 --> 11:26.150
No matter what I say to him,

186
11:26.150 --> 11:27.460
he just responds with "mm."

187
11:27.460 --> 11:28.170
Then I don't know

188
11:28.170 --> 11:30.170
how to keep the conversation going.

189
11:30.460 --> 11:32.250
It's especially true for me.

190
11:32.770 --> 11:34.050
Isn't that great?

191
11:34.270 --> 11:35.360
You can ask him directly

192
11:35.360 --> 11:36.890
if he can be your boyfriend.

193
11:36.960 --> 11:37.890
He'll say, "Mm."

194
11:38.010 --> 11:38.960
You ask to borrow a million from him,

195
11:38.960 --> 11:40.420
and he'll still say, "Mm."

196
11:41.820 --> 11:42.620
That's right.

197
11:42.870 --> 11:45.130
Crack the hard nut with another hard nut.

198
11:45.750 --> 11:46.550
Let's go.

199
11:46.620 --> 11:47.120
Mm.

200
12:15.100 --> 12:16.270
Hello, welcome.

201
12:16.440 --> 12:18.200
Hello, welcome.

202
12:37.080 --> 12:39.350
I've seen you waiting here for a long time.

203
12:39.350 --> 12:41.350
Are you waiting for the rain to stop?

204
12:44.870 --> 12:45.870
This rain won't stop

205
12:45.870 --> 12:47.130
anytime soon, I think.

206
12:48.290 --> 12:49.420
Take this umbrella.

207
12:49.970 --> 12:51.060
But what about you?

208
12:51.580 --> 12:53.090
It'll still be a while before I get off work.

209
12:53.090 --> 12:55.220
Hopefully, the rain will stop by then.

210
12:56.780 --> 12:57.350
It's fine.

211
12:57.350 --> 12:59.350
You can return it to me another time.

212
13:04.480 --> 13:05.270
Thank you.

213
13:07.850 --> 13:08.690
Welcome.

214
13:42.220 --> 13:42.940
Senior,

215
13:42.940 --> 13:43.740
does our advisor

216
13:43.740 --> 13:45.600
not usually hold group meetings?

217
13:46.870 --> 13:47.800
Group meetings?

218
13:51.480 --> 13:52.940
You want to meet Mr. Zhang?

219
13:53.080 --> 13:54.910
Then you should email him early.

220
13:54.960 --> 13:55.480
Otherwise,

221
13:55.480 --> 13:57.080
you'll never see him in this lifetime.

222
13:57.080 --> 13:58.500
Remember to send a few more,

223
13:58.500 --> 14:00.030
or he probably won't reply.

224
14:02.240 --> 14:04.580
2D planar rotation matrix.

225
14:04.870 --> 14:06.270
What is a matrix?

226
14:06.720 --> 14:08.220
On the surface,

227
14:08.270 --> 14:10.750
a matrix is numbers arranged in a rectangular array...

228
14:10.750 --> 14:11.550
Yun Li.

229
14:12.790 --> 14:13.420
Lili!

230
14:14.340 --> 14:15.820
But from a geometric perspective...

231
14:15.820 --> 14:16.530
Come out.

232
14:17.440 --> 14:19.080
You should remember this—

233
14:19.240 --> 14:21.370
a matrix is a change of coordinates.

234
14:22.030 --> 14:23.840
In a coordinate system,

235
14:23.840 --> 14:25.320
all operations involve...

236
14:25.320 --> 14:26.670
Why did you come in?

237
14:27.860 --> 14:29.260
Be it translating a point

238
14:29.630 --> 14:31.250
or rotating an object...

239
14:31.250 --> 14:32.640
Let's have lunch together today.

240
14:32.640 --> 14:33.990
Our club has recruited new members.

241
14:33.990 --> 14:34.540
The seniors

242
14:34.540 --> 14:35.840
invited us to have lunch together.

243
14:35.840 --> 14:37.480
You can come and get to know them.

244
14:37.480 --> 14:38.580
I'm not going.

245
14:39.240 --> 14:40.050
I can't go.

246
14:40.120 --> 14:41.630
There are way too many people. I...

247
14:41.630 --> 14:42.440
I'm not going.

248
14:43.130 --> 14:43.980
Go join us.

249
14:44.360 --> 14:45.150
Nope.

250
14:48.340 --> 14:50.100
You look so busy.

251
14:51.630 --> 14:52.270
Yeah.

252
14:52.270 --> 14:53.010
So,

253
14:53.130 --> 14:54.980
you should go have lunch first.

254
14:55.220 --> 14:56.770
Your club won't do without you.

255
14:56.770 --> 14:58.530
Go, go ahead.

256
15:00.010 --> 15:02.240
Then remember to come if you're free this afternoon.

257
15:02.240 --> 15:04.840
I'll give it some thought.

258
15:07.080 --> 15:08.140
Make sure you come.

259
15:08.820 --> 15:09.290
I'm off.

260
15:38.370 --> 15:39.170
Hello.

261
15:39.850 --> 15:40.510
Lili,

262
15:40.840 --> 15:41.840
are you at school?

263
15:43.120 --> 15:44.080
Fu-Fu Zhengchu?

264
15:45.080 --> 15:45.840
It's the club fair today.

265
15:45.840 --> 15:47.500
Come and have fun at our booth.

266
15:47.620 --> 15:48.820
Why are you using

267
15:48.820 --> 15:50.440
your uncle's phone?

268
15:50.440 --> 15:51.440
My phone is dead.

269
15:51.440 --> 15:52.340
My uncle came to help,

270
15:52.340 --> 15:53.390
so I used his phone.

271
15:53.390 --> 15:54.120
Come over first.

272
15:54.120 --> 15:55.720
Let's chat when you get here.

273
15:59.760 --> 16:01.290
He came to our school?

274
16:02.590 --> 16:04.320
[Club Fair]

275
16:14.670 --> 16:15.480
Hello, miss,

276
16:15.510 --> 16:16.720
check out the mountaineering club.

277
16:16.720 --> 16:17.550
No, thanks.

278
16:17.550 --> 16:18.270
Please take it.

279
16:18.270 --> 16:19.340
If you change your mind,

280
16:19.340 --> 16:20.240
you can join our club

281
16:20.240 --> 16:21.010
anytime.

282
16:25.250 --> 16:25.980
Lili!

283
16:26.250 --> 16:26.860
Over here!

284
16:29.220 --> 16:30.720
Forget about these.

285
16:31.120 --> 16:32.030
Check out ours.

286
16:32.330 --> 16:33.500
Our skateboard club

287
16:33.530 --> 16:34.240
is one

288
16:34.260 --> 16:36.840
of the few outdoor clubs in our school.

289
16:39.100 --> 16:39.630
And check out

290
16:39.630 --> 16:40.740
all the sponsorships here.

291
16:40.740 --> 16:42.440
I, the president, got them all by myself.

292
16:42.440 --> 16:43.570
Isn't that awesome?

293
16:46.270 --> 16:47.960
With this flyer,

294
16:47.960 --> 16:48.740
you get a 20% discount

295
16:48.740 --> 16:50.220
at EAW.

296
16:50.620 --> 16:52.910
You're taking advantage of your relative,

297
16:52.910 --> 16:54.220
aren't you?

298
16:54.740 --> 16:56.080
What do you mean by "taking advantage"?

299
16:56.080 --> 16:56.720
Look carefully.

300
16:56.720 --> 16:59.180
This is called a commercial collaboration.

301
16:59.480 --> 17:00.980
Senior, can we sign up?

302
17:02.250 --> 17:03.280
Fill out a form first.

303
17:03.280 --> 17:03.780
Okay.

304
17:06.640 --> 17:07.069
Lili,

305
17:07.220 --> 17:07.720
let me take you

306
17:07.720 --> 17:08.960
to say hi to my uncle.

307
17:09.010 --> 17:09.720
Don't bother.

308
17:09.720 --> 17:10.980
No need to disturb him.

309
17:12.980 --> 17:14.710
See? My uncle may be

310
17:14.740 --> 17:16.440
a bit cold usually,

311
17:16.440 --> 17:17.950
but he is still very popular with girls.

312
17:17.950 --> 17:18.819
This is already

313
17:18.849 --> 17:19.980
the fifth one today.

314
17:22.510 --> 17:23.310
Hey!

315
17:23.310 --> 17:24.380
Over here...

316
17:26.380 --> 17:27.180
Senior,

317
17:27.480 --> 17:29.240
what is this device for?

318
17:29.340 --> 17:30.200
VR experience.

319
17:31.030 --> 17:32.110
Can I try it?

320
17:33.510 --> 17:35.440
You can register over there first.

321
17:40.110 --> 17:41.200
Congratulations to Unique

322
17:41.200 --> 17:42.830
on winning the national championship!

323
17:42.830 --> 17:44.220
I'd like to interview the captain,

324
17:44.220 --> 17:44.940
Fu Shize.

325
17:45.240 --> 17:47.030
The national championship trophy

326
17:47.030 --> 17:48.270
is once again engraved

327
17:48.270 --> 17:48.960
with Unique's

328
17:48.960 --> 17:49.830
crescent-shaped emblem.

329
17:49.830 --> 17:50.920
I heard you designed

330
17:50.920 --> 17:52.070
this team emblem yourself.

331
17:52.070 --> 17:53.930
Does it have any special meaning?

332
17:54.680 --> 17:57.080
The crescent represents renewal and hope,

333
17:57.370 --> 17:59.520
guiding us to break through the darkness

334
17:59.520 --> 18:01.650
and bravely venture into the unknown.

335
18:07.590 --> 18:08.180
Lili.

336
18:08.950 --> 18:10.000
Is there anything you like?

337
18:10.000 --> 18:11.330
Pick whatever you like.

338
18:16.010 --> 18:16.810
Lili!

339
18:17.140 --> 18:17.940
What's wrong?

340
18:20.010 --> 18:20.740
Why isn't this

341
18:20.740 --> 18:22.110
the logo

342
18:22.110 --> 18:22.770
of EAW?

343
18:23.980 --> 18:24.980
Oh, you mean this.

344
18:25.370 --> 18:26.850
My uncle had a team

345
18:26.870 --> 18:27.730
back in college.

346
18:27.730 --> 18:29.330
It's their old merchandise,

347
18:29.530 --> 18:30.330
kept at home

348
18:30.330 --> 18:30.980
for a long time.

349
18:30.980 --> 18:32.980
So I brought it here to use as a prize.

350
18:34.240 --> 18:35.460
Pick a power bank.

351
18:35.460 --> 18:37.030
It's our most expensive item today.

352
18:37.030 --> 18:38.160
Is that really okay?

353
18:38.330 --> 18:39.640
Don't be shy.

354
18:40.330 --> 18:40.610
They're

355
18:40.610 --> 18:41.810
all sponsored by EAW.

356
18:45.420 --> 18:46.820
Here you are, the flyers.

357
18:50.550 --> 18:52.280
Do I have to hand out all of them?

358
18:52.780 --> 18:54.140
Isn't it stated in the contract?

359
18:54.140 --> 18:56.140
There are still too many of them.

360
18:56.510 --> 18:57.500
EAW only sponsored

361
18:57.500 --> 18:58.240
this little.

362
18:58.270 --> 18:59.230
I don't think this will do.

363
18:59.230 --> 18:59.790
Uncle,

364
18:59.810 --> 19:00.870
don't you think so?

365
19:01.380 --> 19:02.040
No, I don't.

366
19:02.720 --> 19:03.400
Why?

367
19:05.400 --> 19:06.380
I'm not the one to hand them out.

368
19:06.380 --> 19:06.900
You...

369
19:08.440 --> 19:09.920
I can help hand them out.

370
19:15.850 --> 19:16.610
Uncle,

371
19:16.610 --> 19:17.310
look,

372
19:17.310 --> 19:17.980
this is

373
19:17.980 --> 19:20.040
the difference between you and Lili.

374
19:29.920 --> 19:30.720
Uncle,

375
19:30.980 --> 19:32.850
why are you not helping me hand them out?

376
19:32.850 --> 19:35.050
This is the difference between you two.

377
20:05.090 --> 20:06.000
Fu Shize?

378
20:07.770 --> 20:09.770
I didn't expect to run into you here.

379
20:12.770 --> 20:14.170
What brings you to Nanwu?

380
20:14.750 --> 20:16.480
My cousin got admitted to NUST.

381
20:16.530 --> 20:17.640
I brought him out to walk around

382
20:17.640 --> 20:18.570
and relax a bit.

383
20:21.250 --> 20:22.510
Come on, take a look...

384
20:23.090 --> 20:24.660
Who is this girl?

385
20:25.050 --> 20:27.810
She seems to be Fu Shize's acquaintance.

386
20:27.810 --> 20:28.590
How are you

387
20:29.640 --> 20:30.440
doing lately?

388
20:31.850 --> 20:32.650
I'm good.

389
20:33.610 --> 20:34.470
What about you?

390
20:39.750 --> 20:40.750
Glad to know that.

391
20:48.570 --> 20:49.740
Fu Zhengchu.

392
20:51.640 --> 20:52.770
What's wrong, Lili?

393
20:53.500 --> 20:54.790
Is that your uncle's

394
20:54.790 --> 20:55.660
girlfriend?

395
20:59.460 --> 21:00.290
He's never dated anyone.

396
21:00.290 --> 21:02.020
How could he have a girlfriend?

397
21:03.480 --> 21:03.960
Lili,

398
21:03.960 --> 21:04.550
you hand them out here,

399
21:04.550 --> 21:05.810
and I'll go over there.

400
21:21.160 --> 21:22.270
Then should I

401
21:22.310 --> 21:24.710
take the initiative to make the first move?

402
22:08.940 --> 22:09.850
I won a prize!

403
22:10.510 --> 22:11.040
This way.

404
22:15.240 --> 22:16.500
I want this canvas bag.

405
22:22.440 --> 22:23.460
Have some water.

406
22:39.740 --> 22:41.540
I wasn't asking you to help me...

407
22:45.980 --> 22:46.660
Thank you.

408
22:55.640 --> 22:56.640
Make your choice.

409
22:57.160 --> 22:58.350
We have power banks,

410
22:58.350 --> 22:58.940
bottles,

411
22:58.940 --> 22:59.870
and canvas bags.

412
23:01.830 --> 23:02.890
I want a canvas bag.

413
23:03.980 --> 23:05.110
This is the last one.

414
23:05.110 --> 23:06.170
Congratulations.

415
23:06.510 --> 23:07.310
Thank you.

416
23:11.100 --> 23:13.100
The skateboard club is recruiting!

417
23:14.220 --> 23:14.950
Here you are.

418
23:21.290 --> 23:22.690
Isn't this what you want?

419
23:30.510 --> 23:31.310
Thank you.

420
23:47.070 --> 23:48.380
Don't you feel bad

421
23:48.380 --> 23:50.580
letting your uncle line up there alone?

422
23:50.660 --> 23:52.310
How about we go line up with him?

423
23:52.310 --> 23:53.050
It's fine.

424
23:53.050 --> 23:54.680
My uncle is experienced in lining up.

425
23:54.680 --> 23:56.310
Whenever we hung out before,

426
23:56.380 --> 23:57.380
my uncle was the one

427
23:57.380 --> 23:58.980
who queued up and paid the bills.

428
23:58.980 --> 24:00.110
Lili, you know what?

429
24:00.250 --> 24:00.880
When we were little,

430
24:00.880 --> 24:01.960
as long as my sister and I

431
24:01.960 --> 24:03.010
called him Uncle,

432
24:03.180 --> 24:04.940
we basically got whatever we wanted.

433
24:04.940 --> 24:06.180
He treats us younger generation

434
24:06.180 --> 24:06.910
really well.

435
24:07.680 --> 24:08.480
Lili.

436
24:09.570 --> 24:11.050
Are you from Xifu?

437
24:12.180 --> 24:12.810
Yes.

438
24:12.810 --> 24:14.070
I lived in Xifu

439
24:14.070 --> 24:15.610
until I started my master's.

440
24:15.610 --> 24:17.550
Then you must be a straight-A student at XUST.

441
24:17.550 --> 24:18.350
Nope.

442
24:18.720 --> 24:19.720
I'm just an undergraduate

443
24:19.720 --> 24:21.750
from a regular first-tier university in Xifu.

444
24:21.750 --> 24:23.610
Then why didn't you apply to XUST?

445
24:24.510 --> 24:26.310
I wanted to,

446
24:26.310 --> 24:27.370
but I didn't get in.

447
24:27.550 --> 24:29.550
Not everyone can get admitted to it.

448
24:29.660 --> 24:30.460
That's true.

449
24:30.480 --> 24:32.210
My uncle is no ordinary person.

450
24:39.850 --> 24:42.010
You're from XUST?

451
24:44.220 --> 24:45.050
Lili,

452
24:45.220 --> 24:46.350
you don't know that?

453
24:46.460 --> 24:48.350
My uncle is not only from XUST

454
24:48.350 --> 24:49.920
but also the youngest top scorer

455
24:49.920 --> 24:51.750
in the college entrance exam in the history of Nanwu.

456
24:51.750 --> 24:52.350
He was a few years

457
24:52.350 --> 24:54.010
younger than his classmates.

458
24:57.850 --> 24:58.660
Uncle,

459
24:58.660 --> 24:59.790
where are you going?

460
25:00.660 --> 25:01.680
He's getting shy.

461
25:04.070 --> 25:04.810
Lili,

462
25:04.960 --> 25:05.680
you have no idea

463
25:05.680 --> 25:07.410
how hateful my uncle used to be.

464
25:07.960 --> 25:08.660
When I was little,

465
25:08.660 --> 25:10.480
I was too scared to go to school.

466
25:10.610 --> 25:11.740
My uncle told me that

467
25:12.250 --> 25:13.680
since we were in the same school,

468
25:13.680 --> 25:15.270
he would go to school with me every day

469
25:15.270 --> 25:16.270
and protect me.

470
25:16.310 --> 25:17.110
And I believed

471
25:17.110 --> 25:17.960
what he said.

472
25:18.310 --> 25:19.110
But in the end,

473
25:20.160 --> 25:21.570
he only accompanied me for 2 months,

474
25:21.570 --> 25:22.160
and then he...

475
25:22.160 --> 25:23.220
He skipped a grade.

476
25:23.460 --> 25:24.250
Yes.

477
25:25.960 --> 25:26.770
Lili.

478
25:28.250 --> 25:29.250
How do you know?

479
25:30.510 --> 25:31.920
Didn't you just say that

480
25:31.920 --> 25:33.920
he was younger than his classmates?

481
25:34.960 --> 25:35.960
My uncle did his bachelor's,

482
25:35.960 --> 25:37.610
master's, and PhD all at XUST.

483
25:37.610 --> 25:39.160
If he hadn't taken a leave of absence,

484
25:39.160 --> 25:40.900
he would have finished his PhD by now.

485
25:40.900 --> 25:41.960
A leave of absence?

486
25:43.180 --> 25:43.770
A gap year—

487
25:43.770 --> 25:45.510
isn't it popular now?

488
25:46.250 --> 25:47.580
Anyway, he's in no rush.

489
25:47.850 --> 25:49.920
He started school earlier than others.

490
25:49.920 --> 25:51.480
If he goes back now,

491
25:51.510 --> 25:52.420
he might even run

492
25:52.420 --> 25:53.820
into his old classmates.

493
25:58.380 --> 25:59.180
Fu Zhengchu,

494
25:59.570 --> 26:00.270
I have a question.

495
26:00.270 --> 26:02.420
Did you and your uncle

496
26:02.420 --> 26:04.050
use to chat

497
26:04.050 --> 26:05.510
the way we do?

498
26:05.920 --> 26:06.850
Yes, of course.

499
26:06.880 --> 26:07.810
But my uncle

500
26:07.810 --> 26:08.750
used to be more talkative.

501
26:08.750 --> 26:09.550
Now...

502
26:10.380 --> 26:11.440
he's changed a bit.

503
26:15.070 --> 26:15.610
Uncle,

504
26:16.010 --> 26:16.740
you're back.

505
26:30.010 --> 26:30.740
Thank you.

506
27:08.180 --> 27:09.420
My uncle did his bachelor's,

507
27:09.420 --> 27:11.080
master's, and PhD all at XUST.

508
27:11.350 --> 27:12.810
If he hadn't taken a leave of absence,

509
27:12.810 --> 27:14.870
he would have finished his PhD by now.

510
27:46.810 --> 27:48.270
What exactly happened

511
27:48.530 --> 27:50.530
during his 2-year leave of absence?

512
27:51.050 --> 27:51.810
Why did he

513
27:51.810 --> 27:53.110
change so greatly?

514
28:13.480 --> 28:14.010
Lili.

515
28:16.770 --> 28:19.770
Why are you studying at the library even on a Saturday?

516
28:20.110 --> 28:22.170
There are fewer people on Saturdays.

517
28:24.180 --> 28:24.760
Look,

518
28:24.850 --> 28:26.570
the weather is so nice out there.

519
28:26.570 --> 28:29.070
It's a waste of youth to stay here.

520
28:30.610 --> 28:31.740
Then let me waste it.

521
28:32.640 --> 28:33.180
Let's go.

522
28:34.940 --> 28:35.680
Let's go.

523
28:38.590 --> 28:39.050
Come on.

524
28:48.310 --> 28:49.980
Look at your little face

525
28:49.980 --> 28:51.370
and your complexion.

526
28:51.510 --> 28:52.660
You should hang out more

527
28:52.660 --> 28:54.850
to bask in the sun.

528
28:56.720 --> 28:57.720
Forget about it.

529
28:58.680 --> 29:00.620
I still have to stay strong and work independently.

530
29:00.620 --> 29:01.740
Otherwise, my 3 years of graduate school

531
29:01.740 --> 29:03.570
will end up like medical school.

532
29:04.220 --> 29:05.180
You know what?

533
29:05.510 --> 29:06.760
I finally met

534
29:06.780 --> 29:08.710
my graduate advisor the other day.

535
29:09.570 --> 29:10.420
Then I asked him,

536
29:10.420 --> 29:11.380
"Do you have any advice

537
29:11.380 --> 29:12.640
on my research focus?"

538
29:12.850 --> 29:13.810
And he said...

539
29:14.610 --> 29:16.610
Your proposal is quite impressive.

540
29:17.610 --> 29:19.050
I happen to have a college classmate

541
29:19.050 --> 29:20.350
who is a professor overseas.

542
29:20.350 --> 29:21.610
If you're interested,

543
29:21.660 --> 29:22.420
I can recommend you

544
29:22.420 --> 29:24.480
for his lab to study there for a while.

545
29:24.570 --> 29:26.980
Then what about my thesis?

546
29:27.310 --> 29:28.770
You can write your thesis abroad,

547
29:28.770 --> 29:29.610
then translate it into Chinese,

548
29:29.610 --> 29:30.790
and mail it back.

549
29:32.050 --> 29:33.070
I thought,

550
29:33.070 --> 29:35.160
such a nice exchange student opportunity that fell on me

551
29:35.160 --> 29:36.050
must be

552
29:36.070 --> 29:37.220
a short-term one,

553
29:37.250 --> 29:39.110
lasting about half a year or so.

554
29:39.250 --> 29:40.420
But guess what he said?

555
29:40.420 --> 29:41.280
What did he say?

556
29:42.380 --> 29:44.010
"Why don't you stay for 3 full years

557
29:44.010 --> 29:45.210
before coming back?"

558
29:47.160 --> 29:48.350
What kind of advisor is that?

559
29:48.350 --> 29:49.840
I can't believe it.

560
29:51.900 --> 29:52.850
Guess

561
29:53.160 --> 29:55.820
I have to find my own way out over the next 3 years.

562
30:04.250 --> 30:04.920
Yun Ye?

563
30:06.140 --> 30:06.810
Hello?

564
30:07.460 --> 30:08.250
Hello, Li.

565
30:08.480 --> 30:09.770
Emergency.

566
30:09.880 --> 30:10.950
Can you lend me some money?

567
30:10.950 --> 30:12.480
You're asking me for money?

568
30:12.790 --> 30:13.670
Did you forget that my money

569
30:13.670 --> 30:15.000
was all withheld by Dad?

570
30:15.160 --> 30:16.180
I even have

571
30:16.180 --> 30:18.180
to find an internship to make money now.

572
30:18.180 --> 30:19.510
I don't care about that.

573
30:19.880 --> 30:21.220
Dad cut my allowance

574
30:21.220 --> 30:21.850
in half

575
30:21.850 --> 30:23.310
because I spoke up for you.

576
30:23.640 --> 30:24.070
You know what?

577
30:24.070 --> 30:24.870
A few days ago,

578
30:24.920 --> 30:25.940
he was going to rush to Nanwu

579
30:25.940 --> 30:26.880
and get you back.

580
30:27.260 --> 30:29.180
Fortunately, I stepped in quickly

581
30:29.180 --> 30:30.250
and stopped him.

582
30:30.770 --> 30:31.900
Now I'm out of money.

583
30:32.070 --> 30:32.750
Shouldn't you

584
30:32.750 --> 30:33.880
compensate me a bit?

585
30:34.110 --> 30:35.920
Your dad is way too ruthless.

586
30:36.370 --> 30:38.590
Anyway, just transfer 200 yuan to me first.

587
30:38.590 --> 30:39.480
When I

588
30:39.480 --> 30:40.550
get paid from my part-time job,

589
30:40.550 --> 30:41.510
I'll pay you back.

590
30:41.510 --> 30:42.180
Hold on.

591
30:42.590 --> 30:44.250
You're doing a part-time job?

592
30:44.350 --> 30:45.510
As a high school sophomore, how can you

593
30:45.510 --> 30:46.460
work part-time instead of studying?

594
30:46.460 --> 30:47.740
What about your college entrance exam?

595
30:47.740 --> 30:49.270
Uncle's convenience store is short-staffed.

596
30:49.270 --> 30:50.510
I just come and help out occasionally

597
30:50.510 --> 30:51.970
to earn some pocket money.

598
30:52.160 --> 30:53.240
Don't worry too much.

599
30:53.240 --> 30:54.970
Just transfer the money first.

600
30:57.290 --> 30:57.940
Fine,

601
30:57.940 --> 30:58.880
I'll transfer 200 yuan to you,

602
30:58.880 --> 31:00.480
but stop working part-time.

603
31:00.560 --> 31:01.690
I'll think about it.

604
31:01.960 --> 31:02.550
Yun Ye...

605
31:04.880 --> 31:06.120
He's doing a part-time job.

606
31:06.120 --> 31:06.960
Didn't your dad

607
31:06.960 --> 31:08.340
push Yun Ye into this?

608
31:08.980 --> 31:10.240
You two siblings are

609
31:10.330 --> 31:12.610
really like a beggar and a panhandler.

610
31:14.570 --> 31:15.310
Where do you plan

611
31:15.310 --> 31:16.720
to get your part-time job next?

612
31:16.720 --> 31:17.950
I'm going to EAW.

613
31:18.490 --> 31:19.990
That's right!

614
31:22.610 --> 31:24.220
Working in EAW

615
31:24.220 --> 31:25.380
will give you an advantage

616
31:25.380 --> 31:26.440
in getting your "moon"

617
31:26.440 --> 31:27.270
very soon.

618
31:27.440 --> 31:30.110
A harvest in both career and love.

619
31:30.810 --> 31:32.240
I haven't even gotten closer to him yet.

620
31:32.240 --> 31:33.420
What's there to get?

621
31:33.420 --> 31:34.310
You can do it!

622
31:34.330 --> 31:35.660
Stop talking nonsense.

623
31:40.320 --> 31:41.920
Speaking of career, here comes a call.

624
31:41.920 --> 31:42.980
Answer it quickly.

625
31:44.610 --> 31:45.810
Hello, Jiameng.

626
31:46.140 --> 31:46.920
Yun Li,

627
31:46.920 --> 31:48.240
we received your resume.

628
31:48.240 --> 31:50.220
Are you available for an interview?

629
31:50.220 --> 31:51.350
Yes, I'm available.

630
31:51.420 --> 31:51.980
Okay,

631
31:51.980 --> 31:52.610
we will send you

632
31:52.610 --> 31:53.810
a text notification shortly.

633
31:53.810 --> 31:54.830
See you then.

634
31:55.180 --> 31:55.700
Okay.

635
32:00.880 --> 32:02.230
[Yun Li] [Skills & Expertise]

636
32:07.590 --> 32:09.160
Yun Li, right?

637
32:12.030 --> 32:12.960
You've been

638
32:12.960 --> 32:14.200
well-prepared.

639
32:14.700 --> 32:16.140
But your profile indicates that you're

640
32:16.140 --> 32:18.270
just in your first year of grad school.

641
32:19.330 --> 32:20.050
What made you decide

642
32:20.050 --> 32:21.850
to apply for an internship here?

643
32:23.250 --> 32:24.090
Because...

644
32:24.830 --> 32:26.290
Because the automation major

645
32:26.290 --> 32:28.090
requires not only theoretical knowledge

646
32:28.090 --> 32:29.940
but also practical experience.

647
32:30.330 --> 32:32.350
So I'd like to intern early

648
32:32.500 --> 32:34.100
and apply what I've learned.

649
32:34.250 --> 32:35.350
Yun Li, right?

650
32:39.030 --> 32:40.250
Have you had

651
32:40.440 --> 32:42.460
any relevant internships before?

652
32:48.720 --> 32:49.330
No.

653
32:51.850 --> 32:52.750
Our engineering department

654
32:52.750 --> 32:55.160
is full of graduates from top universities.

655
32:55.160 --> 32:58.460
Your undergraduate school is just average.

656
32:59.740 --> 33:01.470
Do you have any special skills?

657
33:03.290 --> 33:05.550
My undergraduate degree may be average,

658
33:05.620 --> 33:06.350
but if

659
33:06.350 --> 33:07.950
you could give me a chance...

660
33:08.850 --> 33:10.160
This is not a school.

661
33:11.290 --> 33:12.050
Also,

662
33:12.050 --> 33:13.550
I've been talking to you,

663
33:14.330 --> 33:15.960
and you haven't stopped fidgeting.

664
33:15.960 --> 33:18.420
Don't you think you're a bit disrespectful?

665
33:19.530 --> 33:20.400
Sir,

666
33:20.960 --> 33:21.890
you got me wrong.

667
33:21.900 --> 33:23.700
I didn't mean to disrespect you.

668
33:23.750 --> 33:25.090
Please let me finish.

669
33:29.940 --> 33:31.340
Besides being a student,

670
33:31.350 --> 33:32.500
I am also a tech DIY content creator

671
33:32.500 --> 33:33.460
on EAW.

672
33:34.160 --> 33:35.530
I have done many reviews and tests

673
33:35.530 --> 33:36.750
on digital products.

674
33:37.330 --> 33:38.960
So I can not only understand developers' thinking

675
33:38.960 --> 33:40.820
from a professional perspective

676
33:40.900 --> 33:42.550
but also provide objective takes

677
33:42.550 --> 33:43.960
from the average user's point of view.

678
33:43.960 --> 33:45.460
I think this is my value.

679
33:47.050 --> 33:48.030
Your value

680
33:48.900 --> 33:50.400
sounds too illusory.

681
33:51.700 --> 33:52.310
Alright,

682
33:52.500 --> 33:53.050
Yun Li,

683
33:53.350 --> 33:54.960
that's all for today's interview.

684
33:54.960 --> 33:57.360
We will notify you if there are any updates.

685
34:18.190 --> 34:19.960
I guess I failed the interview.

686
34:21.090 --> 34:21.900
Handsome,

687
34:22.300 --> 34:23.610
may I add you on WeChat?

688
34:24.150 --> 34:24.800
Nope.

689
34:26.330 --> 34:27.500
Ms. Idle Crowd?

690
34:30.460 --> 34:31.420
Ms. Idle Crowd!

691
34:34.090 --> 34:35.889
I'm calling you. Come over here.

692
34:41.730 --> 34:42.510
Come on.

693
34:45.170 --> 34:46.360
Ms. Idle Crowd,

694
34:46.980 --> 34:48.980
didn't you just ask me to help you

695
34:48.980 --> 34:50.780
get this handsome guy's WeChat?

696
34:51.210 --> 34:53.170
He thought I wanted it.

697
34:53.570 --> 34:55.170
It made me so embarrassed.

698
34:55.960 --> 34:56.620
You want it?

699
34:58.320 --> 34:58.880
Yeah.

700
34:59.940 --> 35:01.320
She was just too shy

701
35:01.320 --> 35:02.450
to tell you herself.

702
35:03.920 --> 35:05.650
Didn't I already give it to you?

703
35:08.570 --> 35:10.100
So you already asked for it?

704
35:13.570 --> 35:15.010
This is a mess.

705
35:16.320 --> 35:17.520
If you need anything,

706
35:18.110 --> 35:19.910
you can just come to me directly.

707
35:23.570 --> 35:24.630
I'll take my leave.

708
35:30.170 --> 35:32.100
So you two already knew each other.

709
35:35.550 --> 35:36.380
Kind of.

710
35:37.380 --> 35:39.440
Then you should have told me earlier.

711
35:39.860 --> 35:40.760
And I definitely wouldn't

712
35:40.760 --> 35:42.070
have done such a thing.

713
35:42.510 --> 35:44.440
It made me quite embarrassed, too.

714
35:46.170 --> 35:46.820
Forget it.

715
35:48.550 --> 35:49.360
However,

716
35:50.280 --> 35:52.010
when did you ask for his WeChat?

717
35:52.320 --> 35:53.110
Ms. Idle Crowd,

718
35:53.110 --> 35:54.210
I didn't know

719
35:55.180 --> 35:56.110
you had it in you.

720
35:56.570 --> 35:58.010
It's not what you think.

721
35:59.110 --> 36:00.070
No worries,

722
36:00.210 --> 36:01.570
I'm not going to fight you for him.

723
36:01.570 --> 36:02.820
This kind of poor...

724
36:04.030 --> 36:06.830
This kind of incompetent maintenance technician

725
36:06.840 --> 36:08.100
is not appealing to me.

726
36:08.580 --> 36:09.980
What are you talking about?

727
36:09.980 --> 36:10.940
Didn't you see

728
36:11.170 --> 36:12.700
the dust all over his hands?

729
36:13.710 --> 36:14.940
I once thought,

730
36:15.320 --> 36:16.710
as Mr. Xu's friend,

731
36:16.710 --> 36:18.840
he would at least be part of management.

732
36:18.840 --> 36:20.100
But judging from this,

733
36:20.530 --> 36:22.730
they don't seem to be on very good terms.

734
36:23.840 --> 36:25.300
You're quite a catch, huh?

735
36:26.030 --> 36:27.040
I...

736
36:28.730 --> 36:29.670
I guess I'm not bad.

737
36:29.670 --> 36:30.640
You're such a catch,

738
36:30.640 --> 36:32.470
but he still didn't give you his WeChat.

739
36:32.470 --> 36:33.630
That's because...

740
36:33.630 --> 36:34.170
Seems like he

741
36:34.170 --> 36:35.480
has no interest in you.

742
36:36.510 --> 36:37.780
So how outstanding he is,

743
36:37.780 --> 36:38.530
what kind of person he is,

744
36:38.530 --> 36:39.130
and how much he earns

745
36:39.130 --> 36:40.780
have nothing to do with you.

746
36:43.630 --> 36:45.780
Also, I'm Idle Cloud Tick-Tock,

747
36:46.030 --> 36:47.010
not Idle Crowd.

748
36:51.780 --> 36:53.070
She's quite fierce.

749
37:22.900 --> 37:23.630
Hello, Mom.

750
37:24.360 --> 37:25.150
Lili.

751
37:25.710 --> 37:26.640
Are you busy now?

752
37:27.380 --> 37:29.310
How are you settling in over there?

753
37:29.420 --> 37:30.760
Living there alone,

754
37:30.860 --> 37:32.380
you must take good care of yourself.

755
37:32.380 --> 37:33.840
I'm doing quite well, Mom.

756
37:33.980 --> 37:35.240
Nothing bad happened.

757
37:35.300 --> 37:35.960
Okay.

758
37:36.510 --> 37:37.510
I heard from your brother that

759
37:37.510 --> 37:38.920
you're looking for an internship.

760
37:38.920 --> 37:39.670
How is it going?

761
37:39.670 --> 37:40.870
Is it going smoothly?

762
37:41.050 --> 37:42.710
I just finished an interview.

763
37:42.710 --> 37:43.710
I don't know if they

764
37:43.710 --> 37:44.820
want me or not yet.

765
37:45.710 --> 37:47.480
It doesn't matter if they want you or not.

766
37:47.480 --> 37:48.480
Right now, for you,

767
37:48.480 --> 37:50.480
what matters most is to gain experience.

768
37:50.480 --> 37:52.150
If you feel unhappy out there,

769
37:52.150 --> 37:53.280
just come back home.

770
37:53.380 --> 37:55.040
Don't push yourself too much.

771
37:55.150 --> 37:55.960
I got it.

772
37:56.780 --> 37:58.320
She's already so introverted.

773
37:58.320 --> 37:58.980
She barely talks

774
37:58.980 --> 38:00.030
when she's out.

775
38:00.190 --> 38:01.500
With her ear like that,

776
38:01.500 --> 38:03.100
she should just stay at home.

777
38:03.190 --> 38:05.110
It's best for her to stay by our side!

778
38:05.110 --> 38:06.500
Being alone out there,

779
38:06.500 --> 38:07.320
if she gets bullied,

780
38:07.320 --> 38:08.960
no one will even have her back!

781
38:08.960 --> 38:09.500
Dad.

782
38:10.840 --> 38:11.980
Do you know why

783
38:12.010 --> 38:13.940
I don't like wearing a hearing aid?

784
38:14.860 --> 38:16.460
Because I want to be a normal person.

785
38:16.460 --> 38:17.920
And I am a normal person.

786
38:17.920 --> 38:18.920
I just can't hear

787
38:18.920 --> 38:20.180
in one ear. That's all.

788
38:20.650 --> 38:21.550
No one will bully me

789
38:21.550 --> 38:22.590
or look down on me

790
38:22.590 --> 38:23.440
just because

791
38:23.440 --> 38:24.710
I'm deaf in one ear!

792
38:25.650 --> 38:26.960
And I've never seen it

793
38:27.190 --> 38:28.400
as a problem myself all these years.

794
38:28.400 --> 38:28.960
I don't feel like

795
38:28.960 --> 38:29.800
it has ever affected my life

796
38:29.800 --> 38:30.960
or become a burden to me.

797
38:30.960 --> 38:31.510
Why do you

798
38:31.510 --> 38:32.960
keep reminding me over and over again?

799
38:32.960 --> 38:33.690
Even if someone

800
38:33.690 --> 38:34.650
bullies me now,

801
38:34.650 --> 38:35.610
I'm capable

802
38:35.610 --> 38:36.360
of fighting back

803
38:36.360 --> 38:37.300
and protecting myself.

804
38:37.300 --> 38:38.800
I can just do fine on my own.

805
38:39.350 --> 38:40.660
Wait, what do you mean?

806
38:41.500 --> 38:42.190
Hey,

807
38:42.190 --> 38:44.120
is it wrong for me to care about you?

808
38:44.620 --> 38:45.950
How could you

809
38:45.980 --> 38:47.550
have grown up safely without me?

810
38:47.550 --> 38:48.840
And now you're telling me

811
38:48.840 --> 38:50.590
you can do fine on your own?

812
38:51.630 --> 38:52.960
I didn't put it that way.

813
38:53.050 --> 38:53.590
You didn't,

814
38:53.590 --> 38:55.120
but you thought it that way!

815
38:55.600 --> 38:57.070
Buy a plane ticket and come back.

816
38:57.070 --> 38:58.130
I'm not going back.

817
38:58.320 --> 39:00.720
Mom, if there's nothing else, I'll hang up.

818
39:00.780 --> 39:01.440
Lili.

819
39:02.400 --> 39:03.370
You... You know

820
39:03.400 --> 39:04.860
your dad didn't mean that.

821
39:05.170 --> 39:06.120
That's enough.

822
39:06.140 --> 39:07.420
Just don't come back if you don't want to.

823
39:07.420 --> 39:08.820
Fine, I won't go back!

824
39:08.920 --> 39:09.550
My car has arrived.

825
39:09.550 --> 39:10.420
I'm hanging up.

826
39:27.800 --> 39:29.910
[Steal A Moment To Sip Wine Guesthouse]

827
39:38.880 --> 39:40.050
Lili, you're back.

828
39:40.920 --> 39:42.420
Why are you soaking wet?

829
39:42.420 --> 39:43.480
Dry yourself quickly.

830
39:43.480 --> 39:44.150
Thank you.

831
39:45.540 --> 39:46.460
Just call me if you forget

832
39:46.460 --> 39:47.320
your umbrella next time,

833
39:47.320 --> 39:48.480
and I'll pick you up.

834
39:49.010 --> 39:50.410
That's too much trouble.

835
39:50.530 --> 39:51.760
What trouble?

836
39:51.780 --> 39:52.890
We are friends.

837
39:53.260 --> 39:54.960
Don't say things like that anymore.

838
39:54.960 --> 39:56.480
Have some warm water quickly.

839
39:56.480 --> 39:57.280
Thank you.

840
39:58.610 --> 39:59.420
Didn't you

841
39:59.420 --> 40:00.590
go to EAW

842
40:00.590 --> 40:01.460
for an interview today?

843
40:01.460 --> 40:03.260
How did it go? Did you get the job?

844
40:04.760 --> 40:05.820
I don't know yet.

845
40:06.650 --> 40:08.380
What do you mean you don't know?

846
40:08.760 --> 40:09.760
I'll call and ask for you.

847
40:09.760 --> 40:10.500
No, don't bother.

848
40:10.500 --> 40:12.130
I'll just wait for the notice.

849
40:12.130 --> 40:13.530
I'm going back to my room.

850
40:28.150 --> 40:28.960
Yun Li,

851
40:30.010 --> 40:31.690
you can't even

852
40:31.690 --> 40:32.980
get into EAW,

853
40:33.830 --> 40:36.000
and you still want to get closer to him?

854
40:45.960 --> 40:46.460
Hello?

855
40:47.340 --> 40:49.470
This is Fang Yuning from EAW speaking.

856
40:49.650 --> 40:50.760
Hello, Ms. Fang.

857
40:50.760 --> 40:52.800
For the job you interviewed for,

858
40:52.800 --> 40:53.590
we've already found

859
40:53.590 --> 40:54.850
a suitable candidate.

860
40:57.050 --> 40:58.000
I-I see.

861
40:58.000 --> 40:58.800
Thank you.

862
40:59.380 --> 41:00.170
However,

863
41:00.230 --> 41:02.460
the publicity department is still short-staffed.

864
41:02.460 --> 41:04.120
Would you like to give it a try?

865
41:05.000 --> 41:06.530
The publicity department?

866
41:06.960 --> 41:08.370
I watched the store-review videos

867
41:08.370 --> 41:09.690
you posted on EAW.

868
41:09.920 --> 41:10.920
They are well shot

869
41:11.010 --> 41:12.260
with many details.

870
41:12.420 --> 41:14.480
I think you are quite suitable for it.

871
41:14.550 --> 41:16.000
Although it's not the job

872
41:16.000 --> 41:17.800
you initially interviewed for,

873
41:18.210 --> 41:19.280
would you consider it?

874
41:19.280 --> 41:20.920
I don't need any more consideration.

875
41:20.920 --> 41:22.120
I want to give it a try.

876
41:23.180 --> 41:23.970
Thank you.

877
41:31.900 --> 41:32.800
Xia.

878
41:36.650 --> 41:37.320
Thank you.

879
41:37.320 --> 41:39.370
You are so nice.

880
41:39.390 --> 41:40.290
What happened?

881
41:40.360 --> 41:41.960
What are you thanking me for?

882
41:45.150 --> 41:45.940
Uncle.

883
41:47.840 --> 41:49.380
And thank you, too.
